--
--   $$J(p)=\int_{\mathbb R}\frac{e^{2\pi i(v(1+i))^2}}{D(p+v(1+i))}(1+i)\,dv.$$
--
--   Then $|J(p)|\le4/5$.
--
--   This sharp uniform estimate is used in the remainder bound.
